  "prefLabel": "En 1303.03 Requestor Obligation to Negotiate",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "En 1303.03 Requestor Obligation to Negotiate. A person entitled to access under these rules seeking a pole attachment shall contact the owner or owners of the pole and negotiate in good faith and execute an agreement for such attachment. A prospective attaching entity may submit a request for access to a utility’s poles pursuant to En 1303.04 prior to negotiating and executing a pole attachment agreement with the pole owner or owners.\n\nSource. #13497, eff 12-1-22 (see Revision Note at chapter heading for En 1300)",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/en1300.html"
